  "modified": "2026-09-15T15:39:16Z",
  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory leak in the MSL decoder on group end tags\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-86421.patch: destroy draw_info for each\n       grouped image in the group cleanup loop in MSLEndElement() in\n       coders/msl.c\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-86421-1.patch: bound the group cleanup loop\n       on msl_info->n in MSLEndElement() in coders/msl.c, so the added\n       DestroyDrawInfo() cannot run past the base of the stack when a\n       second <group> re-uses a stale numImages count\n     - CVE-2026-86421",
